      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm managing a rental property in Phoenix and the tenant is complaining that one of the upstairs bedrooms isn't cooling down even though the AC is running constantly. The rest of the house seems fine. What are some common reasons why just one room would stay hot like that?",
